  topicId: ptype
  title: P-Type Doping
  summary: Trivalent Group III acceptors (B, Al, Ga, In) leave an incomplete bond (a hole). Majority = holes (p ~ NA), minority = electrons (n = ni^2 / p). Stays electrically neutral.
